Maintainer: Kalle Hagen <dev@hammarang-solutions.se>
Homepage: https://git.cls.net/kalle/Agilent_34401a_GUI
Description: Linux GUI for HP/Agilent/Keysight 34401A Multimeter
 Control and data-logging software for the HP/Agilent/Keysight 34401A
 digital multimeter via RS-232 serial connection.
 .
 Supports all 10 measurement modes (VDC, ADC, VAC, AAC, 2W/4W resistance,
 frequency, period, diode and continuity) with live display, MIN/MAX/AVG
 statistics and configurable sampling rate.
 .
 Python 3.14 runtime is bundled – no system Python required.
